A field the new version removes, that nothing maps or drops: a forgotten
rename would otherwise be silent data loss.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
schema: {
	before:    string
	unchanged: string
}
-- ship/1.0.thema --
schema: {
	after:     string
	unchanged: string
}

forward: {
	after: "x"
}
-- out/error --
0.0 declares before and 1.0 does not, and nothing maps it: write <field>: input.before to move it, or before: drop:
    1.0.thema:6:1
